  "bodyHash": "6K1fKc+CANE=",
  "content": "<h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\">這是 Backpacked 的 <strong>Fabric</strong> 版本，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Forge</strong> 版本</span></a><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;也可使用！</span></span></h2><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/670/640/backpacked_banner.png\" width=\"1100\" height=\"270\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/503/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"Fabric\" width=\"105\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mrcrayfish.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/500/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"MrCrayfish 的網站\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/MrCrayfishMinecraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/499/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"MrCrayfish 的 YouTube\" width=\"119\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrcrayfish\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/336389026586165261?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Discord&amp;logoColor=902121\" alt=\"MrCrayfish 的 Discord\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#9e0b0f\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/503/251/warning_icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"22\" height=\"24\">&nbsp;重要：</strong></span></span> Backpacked 需要安裝 <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/503/244/icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framework-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Framework (Fabric)</span></a>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>📖 關於：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Backpacked 不僅僅是另一個背包模組。除了您期望模組中新增的功能外，Backpacked 還透過挑戰等進度系統提供有趣的遊戲體驗。完成挑戰有助於自訂背包；這是一個新系統，允許玩家使用不同模型來個性化他們的背包。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">透過引入扒竊機制，玩家可以從背包中分享物品。您必須直接站在玩家身後並在手臂可及的範圍內才能存取他們的背包。別擔心，這可以透過豐富的配置選項進行自訂或完全禁用。從能夠更改背包儲存大小、死亡時保留背包等等！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此模組中的所有選單和模型都經過設計，以保持原版的外觀和感覺，非常適合不想破壞原版體驗的玩家。&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Backpacked 包含對&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/639/925/trinkets_icon.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\">&nbsp;<strong>Trinkets (Fabric)&nbsp;</strong>的支援（推薦），以提供更好的兼容性。</span><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>✅ 功能：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">為玩家提供額外的物品欄儲存空間。&nbsp;<strong>按 B 鍵打開背包！</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用不同模型自訂您的背包。完成挑戰以解鎖更多背包。&nbsp;<strong>收集全部！</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">扒竊機制。與其他玩家分享您背包中的物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">架子可以在世界中存放和展示您解鎖的背包。支援漏斗！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">大量配置選項。禁止物品放入背包、更改扒竊機制等等！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">支援 <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/639/925/trinkets_icon.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trinkets\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Trinkets (Fabric)</span></strong></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">開發者可以透過附加模組添加額外的背包（參見 <a href=\"https://github.com/MrCrayfish/BackpackedAddon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">範例模組</span></a>）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">具有精緻選單和模型的原版外觀和感覺！</span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/510/126/backpacks.gif\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p><p><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/510/125/newscreenshot4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/510/135/newscreenshot5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">🙋‍♀️ <strong>需要支援或想關注模組開發：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">評論區不適合提供支援，這就是為什麼 MrCrayfish 建議您加入 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrcrayfish\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/639/927/discord_icon.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"24\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;Discord 社群</span></a>。您可以獲得安裝和配置模組的幫助、解決崩潰問題等等！此外，您還可以搶先獲得模組更新和開發的新聞（比任何地方都早！）。<strong>點擊下方橫幅加入 🔽</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrcrayfish\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/639/926/310/172/discordbanner.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"88\"></a></span></p>",
